@host = http://localhost:3000
@cookie = next-auth.session-token={{SESSION_TOKEN}}
@userId = user-id
@featureId = feature-id
@permissionId = permission-id

### Health check local (opcional)
GET {{host}}/api/system/status

### Listar features de acesso
GET {{host}}/api/access/features
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Criar feature de acesso
POST {{host}}/api/access/features
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
  "key": "agenda:read",
  "name": "Agenda leitura",
  "description": "Permite consultar agenda",
  "route": "/agenda",
  "showInMenu": true,
  "showInDashboard": true,
  "sortOrder": 10,
  "enabled": true
}

### Listar permissoes customizadas
GET {{host}}/api/access/permissions
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### Criar/atualizar permissao por usuario
PUT {{host}}/api/access/permissions
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "featureId": "{{featureId}}",
  "canAccess": true
}

### Remover permissao customizada
DELETE {{host}}/api/access/permissions
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
  "permissionId": "{{permissionId}}"
}
